{"seq":6,"slug":"webassembly-compilation","title":"WebAssembly 与编译目标","stage":"DONE","category":"editors-compilers","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/webassembly-compilation","rating":{"composite":3.6,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# WebAssembly 与编译目标\n\nWebAssembly 起初被当作「让 C/C++ 在浏览器里跑得快」的补丁，如今它已长成一个独立的编译目标与可移植执行平台——一份被精心约束的虚拟指令集，既能在浏览器引擎、独立运行时里以接近原生的速度执行，又始终活在可验证的沙箱之内。这个 hub 沿着一条递进的主线，把它从最底层的字节码一路讲到通用软件组合层。\n\n第一条主线是基础。要理解后面所有话题，必须先看清 Wasm 的执行模型：一台结构化控制流的栈式虚拟机、一块连续的线性内存、一套只有四种数值类型加引用类型的极小类型系统，以及人类可读的文本格式 WAT 如何映射到二进制模块结构。这是地基，决定了之后的编译与运行时为何如此设计。\n\n第二条主线是「如何把语言编译到 Wasm」。绝大多数工具链都汇入 LLVM 的 Wasm 后端，Rust 与 C++ 是当下最成熟的两条路。但把高级语言塞进这台栈机并不轻松：垃圾回收、异常、协程、动态分发都曾是缺口，Wasm 3.0 的 WasmGC、异常处理与尾调用正是为弥合它们而来。\n\n第三条主线把 Wasm 带出浏览器。独立运行时如何用 baseline 与优化 JIT、乃至 AOT 来权衡冷启动与峰值性能；WASI 如何给沙箱里的代码一套可移植、能力安全的系统接口；主机与 Wasm 之间又如何跨越类型鸿沟传递数据。\n\n第四条主线是应用与生态：浏览器内的高性能计算、边缘与服务端的轻量隔离单元，以及组件模型——它试图把前三条主线的成果拼成一张跨语言、可组合的统一软件网络，这正是 Wasm 作为「通用编译目标」的终局想象。\n\n四章顺序阅读，便是一条从指令到生态的完整脉络。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"wasm-foundations","title":"WebAssembly 基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/webassembly-compilation/wasm-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bytecode-execution-model","title":"字节码与执行模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/webassembly-compilation/wasm-foundations/bytecode-execution-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"linear-memory-types","title":"线性内存与类型系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/webassembly-compilation/wasm-foundations/linear-memory-types"},{"seq":3,"slug":"wat-module-structure","title":"文本格式 WAT 与模块结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/webassembly-compilation/wasm-foundations/wat-module-structure"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"compiling-to-wasm","title":"编译到 Wasm","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/webassembly-compilation/compiling-to-wasm","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"llvm-wasm-backend","title":"LLVM 与 Wasm 后端","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/webassembly-compilation/compiling-to-wasm/llvm-wasm-backend"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rust-cpp-toolchains","title":"Rust 与 C++ 工具链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/webassembly-compilation/compiling-to-wasm/rust-cpp-toolchains"},{"seq":3,"slug":"high-level-language-challenges","title":"高级语言编译的挑战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/webassembly-compilation/compiling-to-wasm/high-level-language-challenges"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"runtime-execution","title":"运行时与执行","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/webassembly-compilation/runtime-execution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"runtimes-jit","title":"Wasm 运行时与即时编译","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/webassembly-compilation/runtime-execution/runtimes-jit"},{"seq":2,"slug":"wasi-system-interface","title":"WASI 系统接口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/webassembly-compilation/runtime-execution/wasi-system-interface"},{"seq":3,"slug":"host-bindings-interop","title":"主机绑定与互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/webassembly-compilation/runtime-execution/host-bindings-interop"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applications-ecosystem","title":"应用与生态","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/webassembly-compilation/applications-ecosystem","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"in-browser-compute","title":"浏览器内高性能计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/webassembly-compilation/applications-ecosystem/in-browser-compute"},{"seq":2,"slug":"edge-server-wasm","title":"边缘与服务端 Wasm","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/webassembly-compilation/applications-ecosystem/edge-server-wasm"},{"seq":3,"slug":"component-model-future","title":"组件模型与未来","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/webassembly-compilation/applications-ecosystem/component-model-future"}]}]}